# aidbg — AI Code Debugger

Multi-language AI debugger powered by local LLM (DeepSeek via Ollama).

## Features

- Fix Python, C, C++, Java, JavaScript
- Compiler-level validation
- Safe fix with automatic backup
- VS Code integration
- Works offline

## Install

```bash
pip install aidbg
